     3	> Status: foundation frozen except final verdict and pull mode. Universe, classification, Config, dispatch, extraction and human-review intake froze on October 18, 2026; the library and matching labels on October 20; the full review completed October 22. D149 adds extraction-time grouping, not yet integrated into the default pipeline. English edition: October 25, 2026 (D163).
