   160	
   161	<!-- generated: open -->
   162	- Validate each category prompt on stored items before settling it; record its version in Config.
   163	- Research thesis granularity: avoid only financial metrics, bundling separate questions or splitting one question too finely. See the library's open questions; reflect the decision in prompts after research.
