   218	
   219	<!-- generated: evidence-example -->
   220	| Item | Evidence comparison | Library result | Rejudgement |
   221	|---|---|---|---|
   222	| February 5 call: capex guidance up 12% | New evidence; none previously under this thesis | Add g1 | Rejudge |
   223	| February 6 Reuters report retells the guidance | Repeat of g1 | Add a source reference to g1 | No rejudgement |
   224	| March 10 Morgan Stanley forecast: up 18% | New evidence from another speaker | Add m1 | Rejudge |
   225	| April 30 call: guidance revised to 25% growth | Replace g1 | g2 is in force; g1 is replaced | Rejudge, reading “12% → 25%” |
