   109	| T14 Calendar | Scheduled dates that can set due dates | Fact |
   110	| T15 Third-party measurements | Measured operating data as quantitative evidence | Fact; identify the third-party measurement |
   111	| T16 Reference data | Not tracked by default | — |
   112	
   113	Read every whole file, including tables. A table release is one item and is read as a whole batch. Do not separately ingest XBRL facts already in the filing. Whether to fetch exact settlement numbers is deferred to pull-mode design.
   114	<!-- /generated: categories -->
