   184	## Determine associations during extraction
   185	
   186	<!-- generated: relations -->
   187	- D149 requirement: while reading the full text, decide which continuing business process each candidate belongs to, called a research group. Rubin shipments and SK factory deployment retain separate questions while sharing the Rubin rollout group. Group during extraction, not in the frontend or a later whole-library clustering pass.
