   262	## Open or closed
   263	
   264	<!-- generated: lifecycle -->
   265	```
   266	A thesis | Open or closed? (This is the only lifecycle switch)
   267	├─ Open → Rejudge when its inputs change, under the rejudgement rule (When matching opens theses, only one for the same focus at a time; numeric quantities may have one each for this year and next year)
   268	└─ Closed → No updates or rejudgement (Retain its closing state: the last rung if judged, otherwise not yet judged. Keep it searchable in the library.)
