   366	1. Proposal for later pull-mode design: besides due-date freezing, distinguish an unavailable answer (quantity no longer disclosed or event ceases to exist; dependants lack that input) and pending publication (period ended but the number is not yet released).
   367	2. Proposal for later pull-mode design: daily pairwise duplicate checks among open theses of a subject; merge the later thesis into the earlier, move links and dependencies, check cycles and rejudge. Add separate duplicate-check settings to Config.
